<title>BELGIUM: Belgian net debt totalled 9,668.9 bln bfr in Jan.</title>
<headline>Belgian net debt totalled 9,668.9 bln bfr in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury released the following data on the state's debt - (in bln francs)</p>
<p>    STATE DEBT	     end-Jan   change vs Dec</p>
<p>    Gross debt	     9,756.7   +150.9</p>
<p>Long-term debt</p>
<p>    - Belgian francs     6,965.1   -33.7</p>
<p>    - foreign currencies   680.3   +21.7</p>
<p>Short-term debt</p>
<p>    - Belgian francs     1,922.4   +132.1</p>
<p>    - foreign currencies)   75.1   -0.3</p>
<p>    Net debt		 9,668.9   +140.4</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
